4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.239
A genre drummer learns from, and is

5
00:00:10.239 --> 00:00:11.854
checked on, songs of its genre.

6
00:00:12.147 --> 00:00:13.664
So each song needs a genre tag.

7
00:00:13.957 --> 00:00:16.305
Lakh's files carry none: each one is named

8
00:00:16.305 --> 00:00:17.431
