9
00:00:17.724 --> 00:00:19.828
This lesson compares three ways of getting

10
00:00:19.828 --> 00:00:21.980
one: borrowing it from a recording the

11
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.986
file was matched to, letting a machine

12
00:00:23.986 --> 00:00:25.796
listen, and having people label it.

13
00:00:26.309 --> 00:00:28.289
For each one, two questions: how many

14
00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:30.005
