20
00:00:44.331 --> 00:00:46.616
Each match has a confidence from zero to

21
00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:49.012
one, and he counted a match at a half or

22
00:00:49.012 --> 00:00:49.291
more.

23
00:00:49.626 --> 00:00:51.632
Lesson two point four used the same

24
00:00:51.632 --> 00:00:52.858
