25
00:00:53.193 --> 00:00:55.533
The recordings belong to the Million Song

26
00:00:55.533 --> 00:00:58.097
Dataset: data about a million commercial

27
00:00:58.097 --> 00:01:00.271
recordings, with no audio we can use.

28
00:01:00.605 --> 00:01:02.946
And tagtraum's C D two file gives many of

29
00:01:02.946 --> 00:01:05.343
those recordings a genre, itself decided

30
00:01:05.343 --> 00:01:06.402
