31
00:01:06.736 --> 00:01:07.572
Fifteen genres.

32
00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:08.550
Now count.

33
00:01:08.872 --> 00:01:11.014
Of fifty-two thousand seven hundred and

34
00:01:11.014 --> 00:01:13.424
ninety-three songs, seventeen thousand two

35
00:01:13.424 --> 00:01:15.513
hundred and ten match any recording at

36
00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:17.602
