eight percent.

43
00:01:29.278 --> 00:01:30.725
That share is the coverage.

44
00:01:31.046 --> 00:01:32.653
And the ceiling is structural.

45
00:01:32.974 --> 00:01:35.277
Every label borrowed from the Million Song

46
00:01:35.277 --> 00:01:37.473
Dataset rides on Raffel's match, so no

47
