51
00:01:48.437 --> 00:01:50.269
So the label is decided by a vote.

52
00:01:50.592 --> 00:01:52.424
Here it is, one piece at a time.

53
00:01:52.748 --> 00:01:55.280
s is one song: in the code, one file of

