88
00:02:55.433 --> 00:02:56.646
And votes split often.

89
00:02:56.977 --> 00:02:59.293
Of two thousand two hundred and sixty-six

90
00:02:59.293 --> 00:03:01.775
songs with two or more tagged matches, all

91
