the matches agree in only eight hundred

92
00:03:03.981 --> 00:03:06.242
and eighty-six: thirty-nine percent.

93
00:03:09.727 --> 00:03:11.891
tagtraum also publishes a stricter file, C

94
00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:12.276
D two C.

95
00:03:12.565 --> 00:03:14.200
