109
00:03:36.373 --> 00:03:38.597
So every row keeps a flag, c d two c

110
00:03:38.597 --> 00:03:40.535
clean, instead of dropping them.

111
00:03:40.877 --> 00:03:43.328
Whoever uses the labels can take the clean

112
00:03:43.328 --> 00:03:45.837
